<title>POLAND: Ocean group net at PLN 2.1 mln in 1996.</title>
<headline>Ocean group net at PLN 2.1 mln in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean SA results for the financial year, ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.08 vs     2.06</p>
